    "concept": "Iron in kut darkening with the tannic acid of harde",
    "title": "How kut turns black on harde-treated cloth",
    "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
    "createdAt": "2026-11-18T10:30:00Z",
    "html": "<style>\n.kv{display:grid;gap:12px;padding:16px;font:15px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif;color:#1d1b16;background:#faf7f0}\n.kv .row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n.kv .chip{padding:4px 8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #c9bfa8;background:#fff;opacity:.4;transition:opacity .3s ease}\n.kv .chip.on{opacity:1}\n.kv .cloth{height:28px;border-radius:6px;background:#d8c9a3;transition:background .6s ease}\n.kv .cloth.dark{background:#3b2a20}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){.kv .chip,.kv .cloth{transition:none;opacity:1}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"kv\">\n<p>Iron in kut paste meets the tannic acid of harde on the cloth.</p>\n<div class=\"cloth\" id=\"cloth\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A strip of harde-treated cloth\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"cast\"></div>\n<p id=\"said\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<button type=\"button\" id=\"play\" aria-label=\"Play the reaction\">Play</button>\n<button type=\"button\" id=\"step\" aria-label=\"Show the next stage\">Step</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script>\nconst data = JSON.parse(document.getElementById(\"kv-data\").textContent);\nconst stages = [\n  \"Iron in kut paste\",\n  \"Tannic acid from harde\",\n  \"Deep fast chocolate-black colour\"\n];\nconst cast = document.getElementById(\"cast\");\nconst cloth = document.getElementById(\"cloth\");\nconst chips = stages.map(function (stage) {\n  const chip = document.createElement(\"span\");\n  chip.setAttribute(\"class\", \"chip\");\n  chip.textContent = stage;\n  cast.appendChild(chip);\n  return chip;\n});\nlet shown = 0;\nlet timer = null;\nfunction step() {\n  shown = shown % stages.length + 1;\n  chips.forEach(function (chip, index) { chip.setAttribute(\"class\", index < shown ? \"chip on\" : \"chip\"); });\n  cloth.setAttribute(\"class\", shown === stages.length ? \"cloth dark\" : \"cloth\");\n  document.getElementById(\"said\").textContent = shown === stages.length\n    ? \"The iron oxidises with the tannic acid and the print turns black.\"\n    : stages[shown - 1] + \" joins the reaction.\";\n}\ndocument.getElementById(\"step\").addEventListener(\"click\", step);\ndocument.getElementById(\"play\").addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n  if (timer) { clearInterval(timer); timer = null; return; }\n  timer = setInterval(step, 1000);\n});\nif (window.matchMedia(\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\").matches) { shown = stages.length - 1; step(); }\n</script>",
    "htmlSha256": "31d9da6fc6d4c7daf36be42448758c1aca738534111e7a40dd68ddef08eafa01",
